# The bilayer that packmol packed (popc.pdb), with Lipid21 and TIP3P, in a
# cell of 66 x 66 x 83 Å: the box that packmol filled, a margin of 1 Å on
# each side. tleap reports the residues of a lipid (PA, PC, OL) as split
# residues; that is how Lipid21 builds one.
source leaprc.lipid21
source leaprc.water.tip3p
SYS = loadpdb popc.pdb
set SYS box {66.0 66.0 83.0}
saveamberparm SYS popc.prmtop popc.inpcrd
quit
